{"id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#redvoleqn","title":"redvoleqn","path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed.md","line":39,"body":"","kind":"proof","status":"not_started","tex":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed.tex#redvoleqn","uses":["[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_ComparisonGeometry#def:reduced-volume]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_ComparisonGeometry#thm:reduced-volume-monotone]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#thm:kappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#lem:reduced-volume-small-directions]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#claim:l-geodesic-stays-in-ball]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#claim:volume-comparison-time-slices]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_BasicsOfRicciFlow#thm:shi-first-derivative]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed.tex","label":"redvoleqn","line":42,"source":"\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{def:reduced-volume, thm:reduced-volume-monotone, thm:kappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow, prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound, lem:reduced-volume-small-directions, claim:l-geodesic-stays-in-ball, claim:volume-comparison-time-slices, thm:shi-first-derivative}\n\\sketch\n\nReduced-volume monotonicity and hypotheses (4)--(5) give, for\n$0<\\tau\\leq\\tau_0$,\n\\begin{equation}\n\\label{redvoleqn}\n  \\widetilde V_x(W(\\tau))\n  \\geq\\bar\\tau_0^{-n/2}Ve^{-l_0}.\n\\end{equation}\nWrite\n$\\Vol B(x,T,r)=\\varepsilon^nr^n$. If\n$\\varepsilon\\leq\\varepsilon_0$, Proposition~\\ref{step}, applied at\n$\\tau_1=\\varepsilon r^2$, gives\n\\[\n  3\\varepsilon^{n/2}>\n  \\widetilde V_x(W(\\tau_1))\n  \\geq\\bar\\tau_0^{-n/2}Ve^{-l_0}.\n\\]\nThus either $\\varepsilon>\\varepsilon_0$ or\n\\[\n  \\varepsilon\\geq\n  \\frac{V^{2/n}e^{-2l_0/n}}{3^{2/n}\\bar\\tau_0}.\n\\]\nTaking the $n$th power of the smaller lower bound gives the required\n$\\kappa$.\n\\end{proof}\n\n\\begin{proposition}[Upper bound for the reduced volume of $W(\\tau_1)$]","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_ComparisonGeometry%23def%3Areduced-volume\">↗ def:reduced-volume</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_ComparisonGeometry%23thm%3Areduced-volume-monotone\">↗ thm:reduced-volume-monotone</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_NonCollapsed%23thm%3Akappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow\">↗ thm:kappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_NonCollapsed%23prop%3Areduced-volume-upper-bound\">↗ prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_NonCollapsed%23lem%3Areduced-volume-small-directions\">↗ lem:reduced-volume-small-directions</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_NonCollapsed%23claim%3Al-geodesic-stays-in-ball\">↗ claim:l-geodesic-stays-in-ball</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_NonCollapsed%23claim%3Avolume-comparison-time-slices\">↗ claim:volume-comparison-time-slices</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_BasicsOfRicciFlow%23thm%3Ashi-first-derivative\">↗ thm:shi-first-derivative</a> \\sketch </p><p>Reduced-volume monotonicity and hypotheses (4)–(5) give, for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$0&lt;\\tau \\leq \\tau _0$\">$0&lt;\\tau \\leq \\tau _0$</span>, </p><p><span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-726564766f6c65716e\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{equation}   \\widetilde V_x(W(\\tau )) \\geq \\bar\\tau _0^{-n/2}Ve^{-l_0}. \\end{equation}\">\\begin{equation}   \\widetilde V_x(W(\\tau )) \\geq \\bar\\tau _0^{-n/2}Ve^{-l_0}. \\end{equation}</span></p><p> Write <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Vol B(x,T,r)=\\varepsilon ^nr^n$\">$\\Vol B(x,T,r)=\\varepsilon ^nr^n$</span>. If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\varepsilon \\leq \\varepsilon _0$\">$\\varepsilon \\leq \\varepsilon _0$</span>, Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_NonCollapsed%23step\" data-tex-node=\"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#step\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-73746570\">1</a>, applied at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\tau _1=\\varepsilon r^2$\">$\\tau _1=\\varepsilon r^2$</span>, gives </p><p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  3\\varepsilon ^{n/2}&gt; \\widetilde V_x(W(\\tau _1)) \\geq \\bar\\tau _0^{-n/2}Ve^{-l_0}.  \\]\">\\[  3\\varepsilon ^{n/2}&gt; \\widetilde V_x(W(\\tau _1)) \\geq \\bar\\tau _0^{-n/2}Ve^{-l_0}.  \\]</span></p><p> Thus either <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\varepsilon &gt;\\varepsilon _0$\">$\\varepsilon &gt;\\varepsilon _0$</span> or </p><p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\varepsilon \\geq \\frac{V^{2/n}e^{-2l_0/n}}{3^{2/n}\\bar\\tau _0}.  \\]\">\\[  \\varepsilon \\geq \\frac{V^{2/n}e^{-2l_0/n}}{3^{2/n}\\bar\\tau _0}.  \\]</span></p><p> Taking the <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n$\">$n$</span>th power of the smaller lower bound gives the required <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\kappa $\">$\\kappa $</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section> <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[Upper bound for the reduced volume of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$W(\\tau _1)$\">$W(\\tau _1)$</span>]","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#THM","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_ComparisonGeometry#def:reduced-volume","title":"def:reduced-volume","label":"def:reduced-volume"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_ComparisonGeometry#thm:reduced-volume-monotone","title":"thm:reduced-volume-monotone","label":"thm:reduced-volume-monotone"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#thm:kappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow","title":"thm:kappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow","label":"thm:kappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound","title":"prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound","label":"prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#lem:reduced-volume-small-directions","title":"lem:reduced-volume-small-directions","label":"lem:reduced-volume-small-directions"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#claim:l-geodesic-stays-in-ball","title":"claim:l-geodesic-stays-in-ball","label":"claim:l-geodesic-stays-in-ball"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#claim:volume-comparison-time-slices","title":"claim:volume-comparison-time-slices","label":"claim:volume-comparison-time-slices"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_BasicsOfRicciFlow#thm:shi-first-derivative","title":"thm:shi-first-derivative","label":"thm:shi-first-derivative"}],"backlinks":[],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#redvoleqn","title":"redvoleqn","tex":"\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{def:reduced-volume, thm:reduced-volume-monotone, thm:kappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow, prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound, lem:reduced-volume-small-directions, claim:l-geodesic-stays-in-ball, claim:volume-comparison-time-slices, thm:shi-first-derivative}\n\\sketch\n\nReduced-volume monotonicity and hypotheses (4)--(5) give, for\n$0<\\tau\\leq\\tau_0$,\n\\begin{equation}\n\\label{redvoleqn}\n  \\widetilde V_x(W(\\tau))\n  \\geq\\bar\\tau_0^{-n/2}Ve^{-l_0}.\n\\end{equation}\nWrite\n$\\Vol B(x,T,r)=\\varepsilon^nr^n$. If\n$\\varepsilon\\leq\\varepsilon_0$, Proposition~\\ref{step}, applied at\n$\\tau_1=\\varepsilon r^2$, gives\n\\[\n  3\\varepsilon^{n/2}>\n  \\widetilde V_x(W(\\tau_1))\n  \\geq\\bar\\tau_0^{-n/2}Ve^{-l_0}.\n\\]\nThus either $\\varepsilon>\\varepsilon_0$ or\n\\[\n  \\varepsilon\\geq\n  \\frac{V^{2/n}e^{-2l_0/n}}{3^{2/n}\\bar\\tau_0}.\n\\]\nTaking the $n$th power of the smaller lower bound gives the required\n$\\kappa$.\n\\end{proof}\n\n\\begin{proposition}[Upper bound for the reduced volume of $W(\\tau_1)$]","source":"tex/references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_ComparisonGeometry#def:reduced-volume","title":"def:reduced-volume","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_ComparisonGeometry#thm:reduced-volume-monotone","title":"thm:reduced-volume-monotone","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#thm:kappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow","title":"thm:kappa-noncollapsed-generalized-flow","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound","title":"prop:reduced-volume-upper-bound","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#lem:reduced-volume-small-directions","title":"lem:reduced-volume-small-directions","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#claim:l-geodesic-stays-in-ball","title":"claim:l-geodesic-stays-in-ball","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_NonCollapsed#claim:volume-comparison-time-slices","title":"claim:volume-comparison-time-slices","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_BasicsOfRicciFlow#thm:shi-first-derivative","title":"thm:shi-first-derivative","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}